---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Button from '../../shared/components/Button.astro';
import headshot from '../../shared/images/eric-headshot.jpg';
import selfie from './images/eric-and-wife-retouched.png';
import './about.css';
---

<section class="page about-page">
  <p class="eyebrow">The person behind the projects</p>
  <h1>Hi, I'm Eric.</h1>
  <div class="about-section">
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="about-lead">
        I’m a software developer with a soft spot for ambitious ideas and the
        question, “Could we build that?”
      </p>
      <p>
        I like the whole process: talking an idea through, figuring out how the
        pieces fit, and getting something into someone’s hands. I care about
        what it feels like to use just as much as how it works underneath.
      </p>
      <p>
        That curiosity takes me from game worlds to AI experiments to little
        tools that make everyday life easier. I’m especially interested in
        software that works well with people—something useful, a little
        expressive, and worth coming back to.
      </p>
      <p>
        This is where I share some of those ideas as they take shape. You’ll
        find <a href="/projects/">things I’m building</a>,
        <a href="/writing/">notes from along the way</a>, and the occasional
        side quest that turns into a project of its own.
      </p>
    </div>
    <figure class="about-photo">
      <Image
        src={headshot}
        alt="Eric Wich"
        widths={[320, 640, 960]}
        sizes="(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 360px"
        loading="eager"
      />
    </figure>
  </div>
  <div class="about-section about-personal">
    <figure class="about-photo">
      <Image
        src={selfie}
        alt="Eric and his wife smiling together outdoors"
        widths={[320, 640, 960]}
        sizes="(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 360px"
      />
      <figcaption>With my wife, away from the keyboard.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>There’s more to the story.</h2>
      <p>
        I’m also a husband, father, and worship leader. Family, music, and faith
        are part of my life, alongside RPGs, good stories, and something good on
        the grill.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site gives all of that a little room. Some days I’ll write about
        software or share something I’m building. Other days, it might be an
        idea I’m still working through or something that caught my interest.
      </p>
      <p>
        If we share an interest, you have something you’d like to build, or you
        just want to say hello, I’d like to hear from you.
      </p>
      <Button href="/contact/">Say hello ↗</Button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
